SPOILER

By the time you encounter these beasties you should have a powerful character.
You will know when one is about because you can hear it homeing in on your 
brain waves. Two alternatives:
1. Keep away from it and zap and throw things at it until it's dead, then
eat it to regain any lost intelligence. If it starts getting close to you
then teleport away.
2. Put on a ring of conflict and let other monsters do your dirty work.

The following intrinsics are helpful, invisibility, stealth, teleportation,
teleport control.

I got my brains sucked dry the first time i ran into one of these, but
it's just another one of those monsters you have to deal with in a
certain way, other that just walking up to it and bashing it to death.

